# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ATRIX — environment
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored and must stay that
# way. Only NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are exposed to the browser — never prefix a
# secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Canonical origin. Used for metadata, sitemap, Open Graph and structured data.
# No trailing slash.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://atrix.bg

# Analytics is off unless this is exactly "true". With it off, track() calls
# log in development and no-op in production, so no vendor is required to run
# the site. See src/lib/analytics.ts.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ENABLED=false

# Provider IDs, read by whichever script tag you add in the root layout.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GTM_ID=GTM-XXXXXXX
# NEXT_PUBLIC_META_PIXEL_ID=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TIKTOK_PIXEL_ID=

# ── Server-only. Never NEXT_PUBLIC_. ─────────────────────────────────────

# Newsletter provider, used by src/app/api/newsletter/route.ts once wired up.
# KLAVIYO_API_KEY=
# KLAVIYO_LIST_ID=

# Commerce backend, for when the catalog moves off local data.
# See docs/architecture.md → "Replacing the data source".
# SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN=
# SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# Payments. Only ever read server-side, in a route handler or server action.
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
